Package: microsip-linux
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libgtk-4-1, libadwaita-1-0, libglib2.0-0t64, libasound2t64
Description: MicroSIP port to Linux — Rust + GTK4 SIP softphone
 MicroSIP is a lightweight, reliable SIP softphone ported to Linux. Written in
 Rust with a GTK4 interface and system tray (StatusNotifierItem/D-Bus),
 based on the PJSIP stack. Permite cuentas SIP, marcación, llamadas
 entrantes/salientes y minimización a la bandeja del sistema.
